          "text": "ወት ፡ ባለው ፡ ነው ፡ እንጅ ፡ በትእዛዙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለእግዚአብሔር ። ንቃሕ ፡ መዋቲ ፡ ባለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ው ፡ ትእዛዝ ፡ ዘሀለወ ፡ ለዝሉፉ ፡ ለእግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዚአብሔርም ፡ ለትእዛዝም ፡ ቢቀጥሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የተመቸ ። ዮሐ ፡ ፩ ፡ ፲፫ ። ያዕ ፡ ፩ ፡ ፲፰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": "፳፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፬ ፤ ⟪እስመ ፡ ኵሉ ፡ ዘሥጋ ፡ ከመ ፡ ሣዕር ።⟫",
